ID, blocked_by=...)           Remove dependency\\n  check_item(ID, item=N)              Check checklist item\\n  uncheck_item(ID, item=N)            Uncheck checklist item\\n  add_checklist_item(ID, text=...)     Add checklist item\\n  remove_checklist_item(ID, item=N)    Remove obsolete checklist item (destructive)\\n  set_notes(ID, text=..., set=bool?)   Append/set notes\\n  set_parent(ID, parent=...)           Move to new parent\\n  accept_cr(ID, revision=N, evidence=...) Record a reviewer acceptance of a Change Request revision (local board only)\\n  add_resource(ID, name=..., content=..., type=..., description=...)\\n  update_resource(ID, name=..., content=..., type=..., description=...)\\n  delete_resource(ID, name=...)        Delete resource (destructive)\\n  correct_activity(ID, target_event_id=..., kind=..., reason=...)\\n                                        Privileged append-only correction (destructive)\\n\\nAuth (always local):\\n  login(user=..., token=...)           Store token in credentials file\\n  logout()                             Remove active user's token\\n  switch_user(user=...)                Switch active user for remote\\n\\nSafety:\\n  --dry-run     Preview mutation without applying\\n  --confirm     Required for every schema-classified destructive mutation\\n\\nIntrospection:\\n  task-board q 'schema(mutation=NAME)' Show one mutation signature\\n\\nExamples:\\n  task-board m --format json 'set_status(TASK-260218-abc, status=development)'\\n  task-board m --format json 'normalize_legacy_status(STORY-260713-72b914, expected_raw=\\\"in-progress\\\", status=development)'\\n  task-board m --format json 'set_status(STORY-260218-abc, status=done, commit_ack=scope_committed)'\\n  task-board m --format json 'set_estimate(TASK-260218-abc, estimate=estimated, scale=fibonacci, number=5)'\\n  task-board m --format compact 'assign(TASK-260218-abc, agent=claude-opus)'\\n  task-board m --format json --dry-run 'delete(TASK-260218-abc)'\\n  task-board