 an explicit missing/archive filter, but no\n6326|scan result automatically emits an AX tombstone, deletes an observation or\n6327|annotation, or removes the entry from the catalog. Retention and an explicit\n6328|future deletion contract, not absence inference, own removal.\n6329|\n6330|#### 10.8.2 Conversation Lineage and annotations\n6331|\n6332|Conversation Lineage is a derived graph whose nodes are AX Session IDs and\n6333|unmanaged instance IDs. Authoritative edges are exactly <code>ax_fork</code>,\n6334|<code>session_clone</code>, <code>cross_environment_move</code>,\n(more lines below)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
