ault \\\".task-board\\\")\\n      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite\\n      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1167,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 292,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
